#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:106
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&ksnapshot; is a simple applet for taking screenshots. It is capable of "
"capturing images of the whole desktop, a single window a section of a window or "
"a selected region. The images can then be saved in a variety of formats."
msgstr ""

